# Git remote (mandatory)

**The only remote for this project is:**

`https://github.com/audiohacking/FastH3-Live-MLX`

- `origin` **must** point there. Never add or push to `lmangani/h3-ws` or any other GitHub repo from this workspace.
- Before every `git push`, run `git remote -v` and confirm `origin` is `audiohacking/FastH3-Live-MLX`.
- If `origin` is wrong, fix it first:  
  `git remote set-url origin https://github.com/audiohacking/FastH3-Live-MLX.git`
- Do not create secondary remotes that point at other repos.
- A mistaken push to another repo is a critical incident: stop, revert that remote’s `main`/tags to the pre-push SHA, then push only to FastH3-Live-MLX.
